# Line endings. Shell scripts are stored with LF (eol=lf) so bash works under Git Bash and WSL.
# Batch and PowerShell scripts are stored exactly as written (-text): they are CRLF in the repository, and existing
# CRLF scripts must not be renormalised, which "text eol=crlf" would make git report as modified.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.ps1 -text
